  "query_preview": "/THURSDAY NIGHT THROUGH TUESDAY/...\nIssued at 103 PM CDT Tue Sep 8 2026\n\nWe will dry out briefly on Thursday and Friday with highs in \nthe mid to upper 80s. However, we are shaping up to have a wet \nweekend. A surface low will lift out of Minnesota into Ontario, \ndragging an associated cold front through the Northern and \nCentral Plains into our area. This front will bring widespread \nrain and highs will remain in the mid 80s for most of the \nforecast area. Currently models are holding rain off until late \nFriday night/early Saturday morning.",
